# Miscellaneous Commands

## Execute a shell command

```bash
ansible all -m shell -a "echo Hello World"
```

## Execute a command module

```bash
ansible all -m command -a "date"
```

## Reboot all servers

```bash
ansible all -b -m reboot
```

## Shutdown servers

```bash
ansible all -b -m shell -a "shutdown -h now"
```

## Check available disk space

```bash
ansible all -m shell -a "df -h"
```

## Find large files

```bash
ansible all -m shell -a "find / -type f -size +500M"
```

## Search for a file

```bash
ansible all -m shell -a "find / -name nginx.conf"
```

## Check current date and time

```bash
ansible all -m command -a "date"
```

## Verify Python installation

```bash
ansible all -m command -a "python3 --version"
```

## Gather complete system facts

```bash
ansible all -m setup
```
